;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                well, it's a real store, we have one sort of near us in a city called auburn. so i dont think they're official knock-offs, but you never know. they sell clothes, but it's sort of the type of store like a Deb or Rave, not sure if anyone knows what they are, but cheap and tacky <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> so she was really surprised that she found a dress there, and she actually loved it. she is a really picky girl and she only shops at places like gap and jcrew, so for her to be impressed is good!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbie.chalcraft@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.147.88.43","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1194486840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207912.jpg?_r=1386394469","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":162,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ACDCDCAC","Id":207912,"Name":"ACDCDCAC","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bcd6f00ef715ee415a6bd6c51ea7e4ee","RawContent":"Hi All,\n \n Has anyone heard of Brides Against Breast Cancer? Brides donate their used dresses and the organization resells them at steep discounts--all the $ goes to fight breast cancer. A friend of mine donated her dress which was a gorgeous, designer and very expensive dress. She went to the sale to donate the her dress and said they had a great selection at great prices. Problem is, sales are only in select cities on select dates. There aren&#039;t any in my area before my wedding :-( Wish they did it online too!\n \n For those interested, here is the link: \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bridesagainstbreastcancer.org\/\"&gt;Brides Against Breast Cancer&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":319819,"PostDate":1212036819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi All,<br \/> <br \/> Has anyone heard of Brides Against Breast Cancer? Brides donate their used dresses and the organization resells them at steep discounts--all the $ goes to fight breast cancer. A friend of mine donated her dress which was a gorgeous, designer and very expensive dress. She went to the sale to donate the her dress and said they had a great selection at great prices. Problem is, sales are only in select cities on select dates. There aren't any in my area before my wedding :-( Wish they did it online too!<br \/> <br \/> For those interested, here is the link: <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bridesagainstbreastcancer.org\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Brides Against Breast Cancer<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cheng_martha@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1211297594,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209492.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"McCheng","Id":209492,"Name":"McCheng","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7b225583b8e2f29387a732359177406","RawContent":"Good idea to have this all together - good to save time browsing when you get online at 11:00 PM every day! Thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":320014,"PostDate":1212043240,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good idea to have this all together - good to save time browsing when you get online at 11:00 PM every day! Thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>visit my wedsite @ <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/web.mac.com\/kimlemire\/Lemire_Lennon_wedsite\/How_we_Met.html\">http:\/\/web.mac.com\/kimlemire\/Lemire_...ow_we_Met.html<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;116\/st\/20090404\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/e37d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e37d\/event.png<\/a><br><span>28 Guests Booked so far!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kimba1177@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1201082886,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208333.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"S2BLennon","Id":208333,"Name":"S2BLennon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eae3a26940c860a140b01dc772cf2378","RawContent":"&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.onlineweddingdeals.com\"&gt;Online Wedding Deals&lt;\/a&gt; \n \n By far the lowest price for my dress however it was suppose to take 12-14 weeks for delivery. Towards the end of the 14th week my order status had not changed on their website. They gave me some run around story and it wasn&#039;t until I emailed several more times that they shipped it and I rec&#039;d the dress at the end of the 15th week in a very tiny box. So in the end I got my dress for a great price- just a little more stress than I wanted to go through for my dress.\n Price A\n Customer Service- C","Attachments":[],"Id":320066,"PostDate":1212045126,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a href='http:\/\/www.onlineweddingdeals.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Online Wedding Deals<\/a> <br \/> <br \/> By far the lowest price for my dress however it was suppose to take 12-14 weeks for delivery. Towards the end of the 14th week my order status had not changed on their website. They gave me some run around story and it wasn't until I emailed several more times that they shipped it and I rec'd the dress at the end of the 15th week in a very tiny box. So in the end I got my dress for a great price- just a little more stress than I wanted to go through for my dress.<br \/> Price A<br \/> Customer Service- C\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"courtneyryan1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1186115283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207585.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"highheels","Id":207585,"Name":"highheels","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ad078222e4855558860f68359a02a86","RawContent":"HAS ANYONE ORDERED THEIR DRESS FROM HERE? I SAW ONE I ABSOLUTELY LOVE BUT IM WONDERING IF THESE ARE KNOCK OFF&#039;S?&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/doh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Doh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestbridalprices.com\"&gt;Wedding Dresses, Prom Dresses, Wedding Accessories at BestBridalPrices.com&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":322916,"PostDate":1212206410,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n           