Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1619,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1852984,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277331,"Name":"nikkicraig10","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1401549271,"LastPoster":{"Id":285437,"Name":"jyoti1","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":32,"Preview":{"Id":1852984,"PostDate":1401549271,"PostContent":"Has anyone gone or thought of honeymooning in Vegas? I know the thought \"private and romantic\" do...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nikkicraig10@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.174.77.34","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395779138,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nikkicraig10","Id":277331,"Name":"nikkicraig10","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.65.100.98","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77189,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4dc3df3d8bbc9c23df7119651bb06a54","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Has anyone gone or thought of honeymooning in Vegas? I know the thought \"private and romantic\" doesn&#039;t come to mind when thinking of Vegas, but my fiance and I have such a great time there, and would obviously splurge on a nice hotel.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Since we&#039;re having a DW, we don&#039;t want to either a) stay down there while our family and friends go home, and b) get home then turn around and go to another tropical beach resort. We have big plans for a trip one day (Seychelles and Madagascar), but I feel like to come home and say we&#039;ll go on our honeymoon in a year... loses the magic of the honeymoon part, and will just feel like all the other trips we go on. (We travel a lot).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;SO, Vegas anyone!?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852984,"PostDate":1401549271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Has anyone gone or thought of honeymooning in Vegas? I know the thought \"private and romantic\" doesn't come to mind when thinking of Vegas, but my fiance and I have such a great time there, and would obviously splurge on a nice hotel.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Since we're having a DW, we don't want to either a) stay down there while our family and friends go home, and <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/cool.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='B)' \/> get home then turn around and go to another tropical beach resort. We have big plans for a trip one day (Seychelles and Madagascar), but I feel like to come home and say we'll go on our honeymoon in a year... loses the magic of the honeymoon part, and will just feel like all the other trips we go on. (We travel a lot).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>SO, Vegas anyone!?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nikkicraig10@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.174.77.34","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395779138,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nikkicraig10","Id":277331,"Name":"nikkicraig10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77189,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95d2921d2203c284fea3c35ac02790ed","RawContent":"[quote name=\"nikkicraig10\" post=\"1852984\" timestamp=\"1401549271\"]\nHas anyone gone or thought of honeymooning in Vegas? I know the thought \"private and romantic\" doesn&#039;t come to mind when thinking of Vegas, but my fiance and I have such a great time there, and would obviously splurge on a nice hotel.\n\nSince we&#039;re having a DW, we don&#039;t want to either a) stay down there while our family and friends go home, and b) get home then turn around and go to another tropical beach resort. We have big plans for a trip one day (Seychelles and Madagascar), but I feel like to come home and say we&#039;ll go on our honeymoon in a year... loses the magic of the honeymoon part, and will just feel like all the other trips we go on. (We travel a lot).\n\nSO, Vegas anyone!?[\/quote]Yup!! 1.5 ish months after we return from Mexico we will be heading to Vegas. We are super excited. Fianc\u00e9 has never been but I love it there. Was actually my\nFirst choice to get married at but Mexico was a better option for everyone. \n\nI agree, we also want to do it right away so it feels like a honeymoon. We will also pick a nicer hotel than I&#039;d normally go for. Still not sure the Wynn will be in our price range lol. I think if you are within 2 months of your wedding and can prove it, you can get upgrades :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1870760,"PostDate":1410010908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nikkicraig10, on 31 May 2014 - 07:14 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Has anyone gone or thought of honeymooning in Vegas? I know the thought \"private and romantic\" doesn't come to mind when thinking of Vegas, but my fiance and I have such a great time there, and would obviously splurge on a nice hotel.<br><br>\nSince we're having a DW, we don't want to either a) stay down there while our family and friends go home, and <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/cool.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='B)' \/> get home then turn around and go to another tropical beach resort. We have big plans for a trip one day (Seychelles and Madagascar), but I feel like to come home and say we'll go on our honeymoon in a year... loses the magic of the honeymoon part, and will just feel like all the other trips we go on. (We travel a lot).<br><br>\nSO, Vegas anyone!?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nYup!! 1.5 ish months after we return from Mexico we will be heading to Vegas. We are super excited. Fianc\u00e9 has never been but I love it there. Was actually my<br>\nFirst choice to get married at but Mexico was a better option for everyone. <br><br>\nI agree, we also want to do it right away so it feels like a honeymoon. We will also pick a nicer hotel than I'd normally go for. Still not sure the Wynn will be in our price range lol. I think if you are within 2 months of your wedding and can prove it, you can get upgrades <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"116.100.188.49","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77189,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"31667c7461c19f47073887da413e77b1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Las Vegas really suitable for your honeymoon.. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/bet365v.org\/forum\/p\/Bong88\/&#039;&gt;vao bong&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have experience with my lover here&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have a nice honeymoon !!!! &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/bet365v.org\/forum\/p\/kqxs\/&#039;&gt;kqxs&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902199,"PostDate":1439200975,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Las Vegas really suitable for your honeymoon.. <a href='https:\/\/bet365v.org\/forum\/p\/Bong88\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>vao bong<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have experience with my lover here<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have a nice honeymoon !!!! <a href='https:\/\/bet365v.org\/forum\/p\/kqxs\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>kqxs<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:rgb(62,62,62);font-family:Tahoma, Calibri, Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);\">Online updates fastest score at\u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/u99bet.net\/ca-do-bong-da-online-ca-cuoc-the-thao-truc-tuyen\/'>7m<\/a>","Email":"levdung.exc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"116.100.178.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439179240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284343.jpg?_r=1439179533","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"excpomelo","Id":284343,"Name":"excpomelo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"124.253.240.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77189,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee5babfa9f331469dc29d852c5c4e586","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;Hi,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;we got married in Vegas &amp;amp; honeymooned in Hawaii last November.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;We stayed at TI in Vegas which was a really nice hotel givento us by our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.barizaholidays.com\/&#039;&gt;tour package agency&lt;\/a&gt;. Do you know whereabouts in Hawaii you wan to go?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;We stayed at The Royal Hawaiian in Waikiki &amp;amp; Waikoloa Village on Hawaii Big Island.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;The RH is the pink hotel right on Waikiki beach, it&#039;s full of old fashioned charm. I loved it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Waikoloa on BIg Island is a lovely hotel too.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;You need to decide which island to visit before checking out the hotels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908105,"PostDate":1449207820,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>Hi,\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>we got married in Vegas & honeymooned in Hawaii last November.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>We stayed at TI in Vegas which was a really nice hotel givento us by our <a href='http:\/\/www.barizaholidays.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>tour package agency<\/a>. Do you know whereabouts in Hawaii you wan to go?\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>We stayed at The Royal Hawaiian in Waikiki & Waikoloa Village on Hawaii Big Island.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>The RH is the pink hotel right on Waikiki beach, it's full of old fashioned charm. I loved it.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Waikoloa on BIg Island is a lovely hotel too.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>You need to decide which island to visit before checking out the hotels.\u00a0<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chopraaditi1990@gmail.com","IpAddress":"124.253.124.249","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1448511802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jyoti1","Id":285437,"Name":"jyoti1","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77189","Title":"Honeymoon In Vegas?!","LastPostDate":1449207820},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
