you think 9 days total would be enough for the trip (like 2 days travel time and 7 days there). Any tips?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1866814,"PostDate":1408130629,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think this is where we would like to go, we live in the Midwest, do you think 9 days total would be enough for the trip (like 2 days travel time and 7 days there). Any tips?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406736672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77827,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5864fd5cc178a395a3720ca69527621b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My inlaws have been there a couple of times because they do these cruises that are sometimes 60 days long and it&#039;s someplace that they really love. I think 9 days would be great, and enough time. What an awesome honeymoon!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1866859,"PostDate":1408136570,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My inlaws have been there a couple of times because they do these cruises that are sometimes 60 days long and it's someplace that they really love. I think 9 days would be great, and enough time. What an awesome honeymoon!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77827,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ef72d3bceb16941613e8fd513cf2fd3","RawContent":"This is my dream trip too... but it will easily be 10,000 bucks so im not sure if we will be able to swing it and the wedding...\n\nMy tips... COSTO!! They have great prices and packages WITH airfair from LA... check them out... let me know what you think..\n\n9 days will be more than enough from what ive read ... there is no entertainmnet at all and its pretty secluded... so 9 days of just laying around and maybe scuba diving ... should be enough...lol\n[quote name=\"nadiakat17\" post=\"1866814\" timestamp=\"1408130629\"]\nI think this is where we would like to go, we live in the Midwest, do you think 9 days total would be enough for the trip (like 2 days travel time and 7 days there). Any tips?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1866885,"PostDate":1408143232,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is my dream trip too... but it will easily be 10,000 bucks so im not sure if we will be able to swing it and the wedding...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My tips... COSTO!! They have great prices and packages WITH airfair from LA... check them out... let me know what you think..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>9 days will be more than enough from what ive read ... there is no entertainmnet at all and its pretty secluded... so 9 days of just laying around and maybe scuba diving ... should be enough...lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nadiakat17, on 15 August 2014 - 11:23 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I think this is where we would like to go, we live in the Midwest, do you think 9 days total would be enough for the trip (like 2 days travel time and 7 days there). Any tips?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407500627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77827,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58a890076df37cf2228f86e8f6ce515c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ahh thanks- I am a costco member! I am now seeing some tips on another thread&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1866932,"PostDate":1408148422,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ahh thanks- I am a costco member! I am now seeing some tips on another thread<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406736672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77827","Title":"Looking For Honeymooning In Bora Bora Tips","LastPostDate":1408148422},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
