Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":6,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":756,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1897206,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":279050,"Name":"shevette925","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1432591552,"LastPoster":{"Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":60,"Preview":{"Id":1897206,"PostDate":1432591552,"PostContent":"Hey ladies,\u00a0 \u00a0 I know a lot of people do the sand ceremony and the unity candle ceremony to symbo...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunte.henry@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.48.71.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405604630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"shevette925","Id":279050,"Name":"shevette925","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.96.13.12","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81f36ba264872fdfb70087fe1da6e6e3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey ladies,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know a lot of people do the sand ceremony and the unity candle ceremony to symbolize \"two becoming one\". However, neither of these special ceremonies have really spoken to me and I don&#039;t see myself saving a bottle of sand or a candle. Has anyone heard of any other unification ceremonies that they liked?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897206,"PostDate":1432591552,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey ladies,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know a lot of people do the sand ceremony and the unity candle ceremony to symbolize \"two becoming one\". However, neither of these special ceremonies have really spoken to me and I don't see myself saving a bottle of sand or a candle. Has anyone heard of any other unification ceremonies that they liked?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunte.henry@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.48.71.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405604630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"shevette925","Id":279050,"Name":"shevette925","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.35.109.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28412d1ed426f2ef87ebb69b443d577c","RawContent":"@[member=\"shevette925\"] \n\n\nYou can do hand fasting, knot of 3 strands, releasing doves, releasing butterflies, plant a tree (pending your location), wine ceremony... We did the sand ceremony and I did not want to keep the sand or bottles- more clutter.. Lol :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1897211,"PostDate":1432597232,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279050\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279050-shevette925\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">shevette925<\/span><\/a> <br><br>\nYou can do hand fasting, knot of 3 strands, releasing doves, releasing butterflies, plant a tree (pending your location), wine ceremony... We did the sand ceremony and I did not want to keep the sand or bottles- more clutter.. Lol <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376013069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34a0e9d6ab21ef39c276cf0e8f44c5bf","RawContent":"My friend had a small wooden box that held bottle of  wine and at the ceremony they placed in it a letter they each wrote and nailed it shut ( nails already in place so quick to hammer ) to open on their ten year anniversary","Attachments":[],"Id":1897228,"PostDate":1432613420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My friend had a small wooden box that held bottle of  wine and at the ceremony they placed in it a letter they each wrote and nailed it shut ( nails already in place so quick to hammer ) to open on their ten year anniversary \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406736672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.51.131.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79214,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by shevette925, 26 May 2015 - 01:18 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1432675112,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9160a6c35c9d32aceb6213d0b5628626","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I found this &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/blog.myweddingreceptionideas.com\/2014\/12\/11-wedding-unity-ceremony-ideas.html&#039;&gt;website &lt;\/a&gt;with lots of cute options, similar to what&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"nadiakat17\"] and @[member=\"DR2015\"] mentioned. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think we are going to do the hand washing ceremony. It looks simple, beautiful and meaningful. Thanks for the ideas ladies&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897293,"PostDate":1432674932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I found this <a href='http:\/\/blog.myweddingreceptionideas.com\/2014\/12\/11-wedding-unity-ceremony-ideas.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>website <\/a>with lots of cute options, similar to what\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279229\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279229-nadiakat17\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nadiakat17<\/span><\/a> and @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272393\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272393-dr2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DR2015<\/span><\/a> mentioned. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think we are going to do the hand washing ceremony. It looks simple, beautiful and meaningful. Thanks for the ideas ladies\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunte.henry@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.48.71.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405604630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"shevette925","Id":279050,"Name":"shevette925","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.225.204.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd29f43c5db4a89bbccdbf5f631b439a","RawContent":"Im doing a lasso ceremony. Google it and what it means. You may love it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1897316,"PostDate":1432699776,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Im doing a lasso ceremony. Google it and what it means. You may love it! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keredondo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.225.204.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403646019,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BecomingaRiggio","Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"137.122.64.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"197dce8e854db52dc66128f177f00137","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Some cultures do a hand blessing ceremony (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/bridalmusings.com\/2011\/06\/ceremony-reading-blessing-of-the-hands\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/bridalmusings.com\/2011\/06\/ceremony-reading-blessing-of-the-hands\/&lt;\/a&gt;), or pass the rings around for guests to warm with their love\/thoughts. &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897349,"PostDate":1432741965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Some cultures do a hand blessing ceremony (<a href='http:\/\/bridalmusings.com\/2011\/06\/ceremony-reading-blessing-of-the-hands\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bridalmusings...g-of-the-hands\/<\/a>), or pass the rings around for guests to warm with their love\/thoughts. <\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391395223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79214","Title":"Alternatives To Sand Ceremony","LastPostDate":1432741965},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
